Modifications by Glow Launcher contributors:
- rebranding (name, icon, application ID) and Glow default theme;
- disabled Lawnchair network announcements and the nightly auto-updater;
- new Glow code under lawnchair/src/app/lawnchair (files named Glow*): App Library,
  iOS-style edit mode, Customize sheet, page indicator styles, folder backdrop,
  wallpapers and themes, app lock, extra gestures, in-app updater;
- changes to Launcher3 files, each marked with a "Glow:" comment: Hotseat, Workspace,
  PagedView, ShortcutAndWidgetContainer, CellLayout-related touch handling
  (WorkspaceTouchListener, ItemClickHandler), Folder, ActivityAllAppsContainerView,
  AllAppsTransitionController, PageIndicatorDots, EditModeState, ActivityContext,
  OptionsPopupView, WorkspaceStateTransitionAnimation;
- CI workflows (build, signed release).
